**/.secrets/
**/secrets/
**/credentials/

# === Hermes security+media hygiene ===
# media: ignore all video/audio/images unless website asset
*.mp4
*.webm
*.mov
*.avi
*.mkv
*.mpg
*.mpeg
*.mp3
*.wav
*.flac
*.ogg
*.m4a
*.aac
*.png
*.jpg
*.jpeg
*.webp
*.bmp
*.tif
*.tiff
# keep web graphics everywhere
!**/*.svg
!**/*.ico
!**/*.gif
!**/*icon*.*
!**/favicon.*
!**/logo.*
!**/banner.*
!**/og.*
!**/og-image.*
!**/thumbnail.*
!**/hero.*
!**/preview.*
!**/screenshot.*
!**/demo*.*
# keep all media inside web asset dirs
!**/assets/**
!**/public/**
!**/static/**
!**/img/**
!**/images/**
!**/media/**
!**/www/**
!**/css/**
!**/js/**
!**/photos/**
!**/sprites/**
/.hermes

# Generated build, emulator, and lint output can reveal workstation identities
*.log
**/logs/
**/lint-results-*.html
**/lint-results-*.xml
**/lint-results-*.txt
**/lint-results-*.sarif
